  "description": "A lightweight performance optimizer that periodically removes lag-inducing drops and entities.",
  "body": "<p>Transform your Minecraft UI with Mahiru&rsquo;s cute and adorable GUI inspired by <em>The Angel Next Door Spoils Me Rotten</em>! ✨</p>\n<p>Bring a soft, cozy anime aesthetic to your game with a UI themed around Mahiru&rsquo;s gentle and charming style. From sweet pastel tones to clean, comforting visuals, every menu feels like it&rsquo;s been blessed by the &ldquo;Angel Next Door&rdquo; herself.</p>\n<p>Perfect for anime fans who want their Minecraft experience to feel warm, wholesome, and a little extra adorable. Once you try it, the default UI will feel way too plain.</p>\n<p>If you love anime and cozy vibes, you&rsquo;re going to love this! 💫</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(241, 196, 15);\"><strong>Showcase</strong></span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_49da545d-935a-4109-8181-398249750f2d.png\" alt=\"1\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cf9e524b-c770-4755-b170-b82836ee0661.png\" alt=\"2\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bb5b63c4-468a-4e0f-867a-a79c4fc67cab.png\" alt=\"3\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0029d812-5387-41b5-8c36-fb4df0911d89.png\" alt=\"4\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3dff6417-e898-4896-8d3e-576b8c822afe.png\" alt=\"5\" width=\"798\" height=\"449\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1432728/description_1f35b189-50cb-4d31-a8be-4bea8de59835.png\" alt=\"6\" width=\"1024\" height=\"10\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Socials:</span></strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join our discord&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mYfhfWtH8v\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><u><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1238974/description_ab71df94-6fc9-41c3-ae8b-b021beb72514.png\" alt=\"7\"></u></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@NetherSparkStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">✅ Allowed with My Projects</a></strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>You can showcase my work in videos/streams if you give proper credit (e.g., link to the official download).</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You can edit file for personal use only</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>❌ Not Allowed with My Projects</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>You cannot distribute through monetized links (AdFly, Linkvertise, etc.).</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>You cannot edit and re-share my projects .</strong></li>\n</ul>",
